    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Sent to live with her estranged father Nick, 15-year-old Quinn tries to build a new life for herself, including a relationship with her new classmate Kel.</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">After her mother&apos;s death, Quinn is sent to live with her estranged father, Nick, who walked out on their family years ago. Set on hating her new life, Quinn is surprised when she meets Kel. Her new classmate has a reputation around town as a phenom at both baseball and attracting trouble. Once Kel starts bailing on school-- and plans with Quinn-- she is determined to uncover Kel&apos;s secrets. Will more than just her heart get hurt in the process?</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
